			description: [
				"Barrels that swallow stacks, drawers that pack themselves, one window onto all of it - and the &eCrafting Station&r you've had since day one, pulling parts straight from the pile beside it. The island that began with a single chest now keeps its own house."
				""
				"This is the floor the rest of the pack gets built on. When the Infernal tier lands &eRefined Storage&r, the whole thing goes digital - but that's a long way down the line."
			]
